WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
SlendyStuffClicker pairs a Windows EXE with a companion mod for Cookie Clicker on Steam.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Open Set up game. Use Steam → Properties → Installed Files → Browse if the folder is elsewhere.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Add the companion. In the game, open Options → Manage mods, enable SlendyStuffClicker and fully restart.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Set your speed and run limit. Choose normal golden-cookie collection and reduced click effects.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Select buildings and supported upgrade groups. Set cookies to keep in reserve, then enable auto-buy.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
This isolated example runs the real companion against a synthetic game. The counters below are simulated.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Save and fully restart both the game and clicker at least every six hours. Keep the app up to date.
